# What Makes Someone Truly Good at Next.js

Not animations.
Not copying dashboards from YouTube.
Not memorizing hooks.

A strong Next.js engineer understands:

* rendering deeply
* caching deeply
* server/client boundaries
* data architecture
* performance economics
* deployment systems
* user experience under real network conditions

That’s the craft.
Old-school engineering discipline wrapped in modern React architecture. The cathedral hidden inside the neon city.
